## POLARIS COLOR TOKENS (Use These — Never Raw Hex in Admin)

```tsx
// Text
<Text tone="subdued">Secondary text</Text>        // --p-color-text-secondary
<Text tone="critical">Error text</Text>           // --p-color-text-critical
