## REACT ROUTER 7 PATTERNS IN POLARIS PAGES

```tsx
// Loader pattern
export async function loader({ request }: LoaderFunctionArgs) {
  const { session } = await authenticate.admin(request);
  // ... data fetch
  return json({ quizzes, pagination });
}

// Action pattern (form submission)
export async function action({ request }: ActionFunctionArgs) {
  const { session } = await authenticate.admin(request);
  const formData = await request.formData();
  const intent = formData.get("intent") as string;
  // ... handle intent
  return json({ success: true, toast: "Quiz saved!" });
}

// Component pattern — useActionData for toast
export default function QuizzesPage() {
  const { quizzes } = useLoaderData<typeof loader>();
  const actionData = useActionData<typeof action>();
  const submit = useSubmit();
  const navigation = useNavigation();

  const isSaving = navigation.state === "submitting";

  // Show toast from action result
  useEffect(() => {
    if (actionData?.toast) {
      shopify.toast.show(actionData.toast);
    }
  }, [actionData]);

  const handleCreate = () => {
    submit({ intent: "create" }, { method: "post" });
  };

  return (
    <Page title="Quizzes" primaryAction={{ content: "Create quiz", onAction: handleCreate, loading: isSaving }}>
      {/* ... */}
    </Page>
  );
}
```

---

## POLARIS ENFORCEMENT CHECKLIST

Before submitting ANY admin UI:

### Props (Zero Tolerance)
- [ ] `tone` (not `status`) on Badge, Banner, Button
- [ ] `variant` (not `primary`/`plain` boolean) on Button
- [ ] `BlockStack` / `InlineStack` (never legacy `Stack`)
- [ ] No `sectioned` prop on Card (wrap in `BlockStack` instead)
- [ ] `backAction` (not `breadcrumbs`) on Page
- [ ] `shopify.toast.show()` for notifications (not Polaris Toast)
- [ ] `<ui-modal>` web component (not Polaris Modal)

### UX Completeness
- [ ] Loading state on every async operation (button `loading` prop)
- [ ] `SkeletonPage` shown during initial data load
- [ ] `EmptyState` shown when list has zero items
- [ ] Error shown via `Banner tone="critical"` (page-level) or `error` prop (field-level)
- [ ] Success shown via `shopify.toast.show()`
- [ ] Disabled state on save button while submitting
- [ ] Unsaved changes warning (track `isDirty` state, use `useBlocker`)

### Accessibility
- [ ] All form fields have `label` prop
- [ ] `autoComplete="off"` on custom fields (not usernames/passwords)
- [ ] Interactive elements keyboard-accessible
- [ ] Color not the only way to convey status (use text + color)

---

## NEVER IN ADMIN UI

- **Never** use raw HTML (`<div>`, `<p>`, `<button>`) for layout/UI — use Polaris
- **Never** use `style={{ display: "flex" }}` — use `<InlineStack>` or `<BlockStack>`
- **Never** use `style={{ marginTop: "16px" }}` — use `<Box paddingBlockStart="400">`
- **Never** hardcode hex colors in admin JSX
- **Never** use Tailwind, Bootstrap, Material UI, or any non-Polaris CSS framework
- **Never** use `<Modal>` from `@shopify/polaris` in embedded app (use `<ui-modal>`)
- **Never** use `<Toast>` from `@shopify/polaris` (use `shopify.toast.show()`)
- **Never** use legacy `Stack` component
- **Never** omit loading/empty/error states
- **Never** show data without skeleton during load

