## POLARIS ENFORCEMENT RULES (Non-Negotiable)

### Always Use
```tsx
// Spacing — use Polaris tokens
<BlockStack gap="400">    // vertical stack, 16px gap
<InlineStack gap="300">   // horizontal stack, 12px gap
<Box padding="400">       // 16px padding all sides
<Box paddingBlockStart="200">  // 8px top padding only

// Text hierarchy
<Text variant="headingLg">Page headings</Text>
<Text variant="headingMd">Card titles</Text>
<Text variant="bodySm" tone="subdued">Help text</Text>

// Status
<Badge tone="success">Active</Badge>
<Banner tone="warning">Warning message</Banner>
<Button tone="critical">Delete</Button>
```

### Never Write
```tsx
// ❌ These are BANNED in admin UI
<div style={{ display: "flex" }}>     // Use <InlineStack>
<div style={{ marginTop: 16 }}>       // Use <Box paddingBlockStart="400">
<p style={{ color: "#888" }}>         // Use <Text tone="subdued">
<button className="custom-btn">       // Use <Button>
<Stack>                               // Legacy — use BlockStack/InlineStack
<Badge status="success">              // Wrong — use tone=
<Button primary>                      // Wrong — use variant="primary"
<Modal>                               // Wrong in embedded app — use <ui-modal>
<Toast>                               // Wrong — use shopify.toast.show()
```

---

## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] Zero raw HTML elements used for layout (`div`, `p`, `span` for decorative only)
- [ ] All gap/spacing uses Polaris tokens (not raw pixels)
- [ ] Badge/Banner/Button use `tone` and `variant` (not `status`/`primary` booleans)
- [ ] `BlockStack`/`InlineStack` replace all `Stack` usage
- [ ] Loading button state on every async action
- [ ] `SkeletonPage` shown while data loads
- [ ] `EmptyState` shown for every empty list
- [ ] `Banner tone="critical"` for page-level errors
- [ ] `shopify.toast.show()` for success/error transient messages
- [ ] `isDirty` state tracked, unsaved changes warned
- [ ] `useBlocker` prevents navigation with unsaved changes

---

## NEVER

- Never use `style={{ display: "flex" }}` — use `<InlineStack>`
- Never use custom className for Polaris layout — use Polaris primitives
- Never mix Polaris versions (only v13 APIs)
- Never use `<Modal>` from `@shopify/polaris` (App Bridge v4 uses `<ui-modal>`)
- Never omit `autoComplete="off"` on non-standard TextFields
- Never build a page without loading + empty + error states

