## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] `authenticate.admin(request)` first in every loader/action
- [ ] All queries include `shop: session.shop`
- [ ] Polaris v13 prop names used (tone, variant — not status, destructive)
- [ ] `Toast` inside `Frame` wrapper
- [ ] Empty state present when list is empty
- [ ] Loading state via `navigation.state !== "idle"`
- [ ] Error handling in every action with try/catch → json({ error })
- [ ] NavMenu updated when adding new top-level route
- [ ] `npm run typecheck` passes — no `any` types

---

## NEVER

- Never use raw HTML elements inside Polaris layouts (use Card, Layout.Section)
- Never use `router.push()` — use Polaris `url` prop or `redirect()`
- Never skip the empty state on list pages
- Never use deprecated Polaris v12 props (Stack, status on Badge)
- Never query DB without shop scoping
- Never forget Toast inside Frame

