   113→
   114→## DRAG-AND-DROP REORDER (Optimistic UI)
   115→
   116→```tsx
   117→// Optimistic update: show new order immediately, persist to server
   118→const [localOrder, setLocalOrder] = useState(questions.map(q => q.id));
   119→
   120→function handleDragEnd(event: DragEndEvent) {
   121→  const { active, over } = event;
   122→  if (!over || active.id === over.id) return;
   123→  const newOrder = arrayMove(localOrder, localOrder.indexOf(active.id as string), localOrder.indexOf(over.id as string));
   124→  setLocalOrder(newOrder); // Immediate optimistic update
   125→  submit({ intent: "reorderQuestions", orderedIds: JSON.stringify(newOrder) }, { method: "POST" });
   126→}
   127→```
   128→
   129→## IMAGE UPLOAD (image-choice type — Shopify Files API)
   130→
   131→```typescript
   132→async function uploadToShopify(admin: any, file: File): Promise<string> {
   133→  const { data } = await (await admin.graphql(`
   134→    mutation stagedUploadsCreate($input: [StagedUploadInput!]!) {
   135→      stagedUploadsCreate(input: $input) {
   136→        stagedTargets { url resourceUrl parameters { name value } }
   137→        userErrors { field message }
   138→      }
   139→    }
   140→  `, { variables: { input: [{ filename: file.name, mimeType: file.type, resource: "FILE", fileSize: String(file.size) }] } })).json();
   141→  const target = data.stagedUploadsCreate.stagedTargets[0];
   142→  const form = new FormData();
   143→  target.parameters.forEach(({ name, value }: { name: string; value: string }) => form.append(name, value));
   144→  form.append("file", file);
   145→  await fetch(target.url, { method: "POST", body: form });
   146→  return target.resourceUrl; // Store this URL in Answer.imageUrl
   147→}
   148→```
   149→
   150→## PRODUCT TAG ASSIGNMENT
   151→
   152→Answer.productTags = JSON array of strings. These drive the recommendation scoring:
   153→- User selects answer → tags added to response tag pool
   154→- Tag pool matched against ProductMapping.tags
   155→- Match count × 10 = product score
   156→
   157→Tags autocomplete from existing ProductMapping:
   158→```typescript
   159→const allTags = [...new Set((await db.productMapping.findMany({
   160→  where: { shop: session.shop }, select: { tags: true }
   161→})).flatMap(pm => JSON.parse(pm.tags as string)))];
   162→```
   163→
   164→## SELF-VALIDATION CHECKLIST
   165→- [ ] All 8 types have default settings objects
   166→- [ ] Position recompaction after every delete (no gaps)
   167→- [ ] Reorder uses $transaction for atomicity
   168→- [ ] image-choice uses Shopify stagedUploadsCreate
   169→- [ ] Answer productTags is valid JSON array string
   170→- [ ] Choice types always have ≥2 answers (enforce in UI)
