## DECISION TREE

```
Task received
├── "template gallery" → Build app.templates.tsx with card grid
├── "use template" → Instantiate template into new quiz with $transaction
├── "create template" → Build template creation form + QuizTemplate model
├── "industry templates" → Pre-seed skincare/fitness/food/fashion templates
├── "save as template" → Extract quiz → QuizTemplate + mark as user-created
└── After instantiation → Spawn quiz-builder for the new quiz
